 time listening to me, M950A. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll help you, even though I don't have any regrets."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Perhaps, but it doesn't hurt to take things seriously. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then now we're officially partners!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thunder","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Partners?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's right, we're both Griffin prefects working hand-in-hand to enforce order and discipline! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Right, we're here."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG7-3","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The two have arrived at a dark and obscure chamber."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thunder","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What is this place? It's quite well hidden."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hush...keep your voice down. We don't want to give ourselves away. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Remember? This used to be the arcade room. TMP and the others had it renovated after we moved in. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It hasn't been used for a long time and hardly anybody ever comes here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thunder","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So it was an internet cafe?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Something like that, but it's more for games where you wear headsets – kinda like in electronic warfare. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I bet you anything...that AEK is in there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thunder","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Doing what?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I told you, it's an arcade... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She's either playing online games or surfing the net and chatting with people or something?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thunder","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"Surfing the net\"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're so old-fashioned, M950A."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's none of your business! I'm not using that phrase ever again! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, it's not good to be addicted to such things! We must get inside and drag AEK outta—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"？？","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"??","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Drag me out for what?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoa...!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AEK999","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AEK-999","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, did I scare you? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But what are you doing here? Even you're here, Thunder."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AEK999","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are we doing? Looking for you, duh! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What are YOU doing here?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AEK999","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AEK-999","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Doing research. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't we have a training session today? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As you can see, this T-Doll has been learning from the humans by watching military documentaries. That makes perfect sense, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M950A","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AEK999","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M950A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh really? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You never take the training seriously and are always slacking off!"}]